'''Pokémon Communication''' (Japanese: '''ポケモン通信''' ''Pokémon Communication'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Choose a Pokémon in your hand and switch it with a random Pokémon in your deck.
}}

