==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Pokémon Communication}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but the card added from the deck with this card's effect is random.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on the regular print of {{TCG ID|Team Up|Pokémon Communication|152}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.

